\par\par \b \uc2 EU\uc2  will have to match Ukraine's massive financing needs -EU Commission\b0\par\par\uc2 249 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Februar 2022\par 17:34\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 PARIS, Feb 25 (Reuters) - Ukraine's financing needs after the Russian invasion will be massive and the \uc2 European Union\uc2  will have to come up with the money, \uc2 European Commission\uc2  Vice President \uc2 Valdis Dombrovskis\uc2  said on Friday.\par \par \uc2 Speaking after a meeting of \uc2 European Union\uc2  finance ministers and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governors, Dombrovskis said Ukraine was suffering from investor flight and its access to financial markets has been very problematic.\par \par \uc2 Also the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has come under pressure and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves were being depleted in market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "So it is clear that \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's financing needs will be massive, and we will need to match those financing needs," Dombrovskis said.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 EU\uc2  has recently agreed on 1.2 billion euros in macro-financial assistance emergency programme for Kyiv, of which the first half will be disbursed soon, but Dombrovskis said it was clear \uc2 EU\uc2  support would have to go far beyond this.\par \par \uc2 He said before Russia started amassing troops on the Ukrainian border, the estimated financing gap for Ukraine for this year was around 2.5 billion euros. This rose to 5 billion after the build-up of troops as investors fled expecting war.\par \par \uc2 "Now, the financing needs are off-the chart," Dombrovskis said. "We cannot really estimate them, but we need to be ready to support Ukraine in every way we can." (Reporting by Jan Strupczewski and Leigh Thomas) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2022-2-25T17:34:09.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020220225ei2p046jh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
