ange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  equity \par  adjustment                               -  (23,914)            -    (249)  (24,163) \par Depreciation charge \par  for the year                        21,006     5,145            -    1,440    27,591 \par ------------------------------  -----------  --------  -----------  -------  -------- \par At 31 December                      459,551    89,291       32,687   18,081   599,610 \par ------------------------------  -----------  --------  -----------  -------  -------- \par Carrying amount \par ------------------------------  -----------  --------  -----------  -------  -------- \par At 1 January                        168,513   115,375        5,033    3,553   292,474 \par ------------------------------  -----------  --------  -----------  -------  -------- \par At 31 December                      100,635    88,178        3,602    2,234   194,649 \par ------------------------------  -----------  --------  -----------  -------  -------- \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Exceptional item - provision for impairment of oil and gas assets\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 During 2015 impairment triggers were noted in respect of our oil and gas assets in Ukraine and Hungary. Impairment tests were completed resulting in impairments of $51.1m comprised of $49.6m in respect of our Ukrainian oil and gas fields and $1.5m in respect of our Hungarian oil and gas fields (see Note 4 (b)).\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Full impairment disclosures for each of the impairment tests are made in Notes 4 (c), (d), (e) and (f).\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par JKX Oil & Gas PLC Final Results to 31 December -14-\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 4. (b) Intangible assets: exploration and evaluation expenditure \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par 2016                           Ukraine  Hungary       Rest   Total \par                                   $000     $000   of World    $000 \par                                                       $000 \par -----------------------------  ---