\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-\uc2 Ukraine  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  buys $148 mln on interbank market\b0\par\par\uc2 229 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 April 2016\par 19:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2016 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Adds volume of dollars bought in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 KIEV, April 7 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday it had bought $147.5 million at a fixed rate of 25.80 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the dollar on the interbank market, in the first \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of its sort this year, due to a one-off oversupply of dollars.\par \par \uc2 In the first two months of 2016, the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  was under pressure from continued fighting in separatist eastern regions, lower earnings for commodities exporters and a simmering domestic political crisis.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit a 12-month low of below 27 to the dollar in February, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it saw signs of stabilisation in mid-March, forecasting higher export earnings in the second quarter.\par \par \uc2 The interbank market opened at 25.80 on Thursday, compared with Wednesday's close of 25.95.\par \par \uc2 Under existing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls, 75 percent of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  transferred to bank accounts must be sold, leading to occasional oversupply of dollars on the market.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  adopted a flexible exchange rate policy last year, but has said it is prepared to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to prevent excessive volatility. It said the dollars bought on Thursday would be transferred to reserves. (Reporting by Natalia Zinets; Writing by Alessandra Prentice; Editing by Andrew Roche)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2016-4-10T17:43:42.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020160407ec4701qnl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw442\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6630\pichgoal600
