fit ($m)                                      (13.8)        (88.0)      8.5 \par  Net (loss)/profit before exceptional \par   items ($m)                                                 (13.8)        (18.2)     11.2 \par  Basic weighted average number of shares \par   in issue (m)                                                  172           172      172 \par  (Loss)/earnings per share before exceptional \par   items (basic, cents)                                       (8.01)       (19.26)     6.50 \par  (Loss)/earnings per share after exceptional \par   items (basic, cents)                                       (8.01)       (51.16)     4.95 \par  Pre-exceptional earnings before interest, \par   corporation tax, depreciation and amortisation(1) \par   ($m)                                                          6.1          20.3     25.7 \par ------------------------------------------------------  -----------  ------------  ------- \par  \par                                                                                      First \par                                                          First half   Second half     half \par  Realisations                                                  2015          2014     2014 \par ------------------------------------------------------  -----------  ------------  ------- \par  Oil (per bbl)                                               $49.87        $84.56   $92.39 \par  Gas (per Mcf)                                                $4.46         $5.84    $5.64 \par  LPG (per tonne)                                               $448          $806     $808 \par ------------------------------------------------------  -----------  ------------  ------- \par  \par  \par                                                                                      First \par                                                          First half   Second half     half \par  Cost of production ($/boe)                                    2015   