\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine \highlight\uc2  cbank says to continue  \highlight22\uc2 interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 206 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 September 2011\par 17:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 KIEV, Sept 27 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Tuesday it would continue \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in support of the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent excessive volatility that could prompt panic on the cash market, a senior \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The bank has been supporting the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  at around 8.0 per dollar for the last few months, selling dollars frequently to cover the lack of market supply.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not plan to change its policy and abandon the market," Olena Shcherbakova, head of the bank's monetary policy department, told reporters.\par \par \uc2 "Today, when (local) banks have such a large foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  loan book, we do not want to provoke turbulence on the market because this would lead to panic and nobody wants to see panic."\par \par \uc2 Analysts say Ukrainian consumers traditionally increase cash foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases in autumn, affecting overall market dynamics.\par \par \uc2 Shcherbakova said that, cash transactions excluded, the local market was "balanced".\par \par \uc2 Earlier on Tuesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  offered to sell dollars at 7.991 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  per dollar on the interbank market and buy the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 7.971 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  per dollar.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Natalya Zinets; Writing by Olzhas Auyezov)\par \par \uc2 UKRAINE-CBANK/   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110927e79r000vy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
