\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine hryvnia \highlight\uc2  at 6-mth low, cbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 238 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Oktober 2010\par 11:31\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds background, quote)\par \par \uc2 KIEV, Oct 5 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday sold over $100 million at 7.9425 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  <UAH=> per dollar after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  touched a six-month low against the dollar at 7.95 due to what the bank described at seasonal factors.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been weakening since early September after the country's current account deficit surged to $563 million, a record so far this year, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced a reshuffle involving its key \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  decision maker.\par \par \uc2 It also started falling at the time when state energy firm Naftogaz was buying dollars to make a monthly payment for imported Russian natural gas.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and other players said Naftogaz, which must pay Russia's \uc2 Gazprom\uc2  by the 7th day of each month, was the key factor behind the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's weakening on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 "The situation was predictable because everyone knows how every month begins," Valery Lytvytsky, a senior adviser to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chairman, told Reuters. "Our participation was moderate for such period when large players show up -- $100 million."\par \par \uc2 Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  had helped the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to recover to 7.9425 per dollar as other players also started selling dollars. (Reporting by Natalya Zinets; Writing by Olzhas Auyezov; Editing by Richard Balmforth, Ron Askew)\par \par \uc2 UKRAINE-CBANK/\b \highlight22\uc2 HRYVNIA\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101005e6a5000kr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
